# Visual-regression baselines. `**/*.ts` drops the webview sources but not the
# PNGs beside them, so 100 screenshots — the whole approved set, both widths and
# both themes — were riding along in every .vsix. Nothing at runtime reads them.
**/__screenshots__/**
